    "The 10 Top Hits in vitro activation contradiction: Camp B has completely ignored the fact that sgRNA3 was already proven to activate qNCS in vitro in the first paragraph! Press them on this: How can any scientist endorse a choice that claims protein 3 'does not play a role in activating qNCS' when the prompt itself explicitly states it was a top hit in qNCS activation?"
  ]
},
